          "benefitTypes": {
            "id": 1,
            "label": "Cash",
            "value": "cash"
          },
          "benefits": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "bold": true,
                      "text": "Subsidy Assistance: "
                    },
                    {
                      "text": "25% of the cost for:"
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Models up to 40 PTO HP (Max ₹45,000/-)."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                },
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Models above 40 PTO HP and up to 60 PTO HP (Max ₹60,000/-)."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ol_list"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "bold": true,
                  "text": "Note:"
                }
              ],
              "type": "block_quote"
            },
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "Minimum Time Limit (in Years) for Reclaiming  Benefits: 10 years."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "list_item"
                }
              ],
              "type": "ul_list"
            }
          ],
          "benefits_md": "\n- **Subsidy Assistance:** 25% of the cost for:\n\n1. Models up to 40 PTO HP (Max ₹45,000/-).\n1. Models above 40 PTO HP and up to 60 PTO HP (Max ₹60,000/-).\n\n> **Note:**\n\n\n- Minimum Time Limit (in Years) for Reclaiming  Benefits: 10 years.\n\n",
          "briefDescription": "This scheme has been introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat. It aims to provide financial assistance to farmers for purchasing tractors, promoting farm mechanization and increasing farm power availability.\n",
          "detailedDescription": [
            {
              "children": [
                {
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "text": "The scheme \"Assistance to Farmers to Purchase Heavy Farm Equipment (Tractor)\" introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat, aims to support farmers by offering subsidies for the purchase of tractors. It ensures that modern agricultural equipment reaches farmers, enhancing productivity and efficiency."
                    }
                  ],
                  "type": "paragraph"
                }
              ],
              "type": "align_justify"
            }
          ],
          "detailedDescription_md": "The scheme &amp;quot;Assistance to Farmers to Purchase Heavy Farm Equipment (Tractor)&amp;quot; introduced by the Agriculture, Farmers Welfare and Cooperation Department, Gujarat, aims to support farmers by offering subsidies for the purchase of tractors. It ensures that modern agricultural equipment reaches farmers, enhancing productivity and efficiency.\n",
